   0.00-  41.21  We sold Fabian House, a freehold block of 9 flats and 2 shops in Shadwell for $4 .775 million. It had one viewing and one offer, and it was agreed before it was advertised anywhere. The completion date came and went and the buyers money for the next 2 months the whole deal hung on one thing, whether the seller would wait. In this video, I'll go through how the building came to us, how it was priced at 4 .1 % yield, who buys a block like this, and why. What nearly stopped it, and what the buyer got, and.
